          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuboisagha mikate ifunyiro kwa Mlungu, mufu kwa wundu ghwa kizongona cha viro, vishawalata va mkate ghusene chachu, mafunyo gha vindo viochelo, mafunyo ghiranganyiro na mavuda, na kupima vilambo vose seji ving'ane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kula nakesho na luma lwa kenyi wiwukeghee wimfunyire chawucha na kumkasa BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kula ngelo BWANA ufunyirwagha vizongona vekora ituku ja Sabato, na Ndima ya Mori Lukombe na matuku mazima gha karamu; kunughana na seji ghikundikie kari kose imbiri ya BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa chia iyo wichakaia wikiizighana Hema ekwania na andu kwa Wueli; nawo wikaia wikiwitesia waruna wana wa Haruni kwa wudumiki ghwa Hekalu ya BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.32",
